  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>40</mn></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is replaced by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>40</mn></munderover><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>r</mi></msup><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>40</mn></munderover><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>r</mi></msup><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>39</mn></munderover><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> in product of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup></math></p><p>Here, there will be no term of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>.</p><p>Hence, the coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>.</p>"
